  "post_content": "<p>El Ateneo Cultural y Mercantil de Onda ha acogido la noche de este viernes un concierto de jazz de la joven cantante ondense Anna Villar Ripoll&eacute;s, acompa&ntilde;ada por el grupo Benicassim Jazz Project.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_8591.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>En esta ocasi&oacute;n los m&uacute;sicos eran Germ&aacute;n Lul a la guitarra, Gaby Royo al bajo y Ximo Snchis a la bater&iacute;a.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8591.jpg\" alt=\"img_8591\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8593.jpg\" alt=\"img_8593\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8594.jpg\" alt=\"img_8594\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8595.jpg\" alt=\"img_8595\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8596.jpg\" alt=\"img_8596\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8598.jpg\" alt=\"img_8598\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8599.jpg\" alt=\"img_8599\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8600.jpg\" alt=\"img_8600\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8602.jpg\" alt=\"img_8602\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8603.jpg\" alt=\"img_8603\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8605.jpg\" alt=\"img_8605\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8606.jpg\" alt=\"img_8606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8607.jpg\" alt=\"img_8607\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8608.jpg\" alt=\"img_8608\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8609.jpg\" alt=\"img_8609\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jazzannavillarateneu/img_8610.jpg\" alt=\"img_8610\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
